  "description": "Spread sweet retro charm, holiday magic, and playful warmth with Cutie Candy. This delightful font duo pairs a chunky, wavy bubble display font with a smooth, monoline script font, allowing you to mix and match for instant creative contrast. Packed with cheerful energy, heart-dotted accents, and soft rounded curves, it brings an irresistible, handcrafted personality to every design.\nIdeal for Christmas and holiday craft projects, cute sticker packs, kids’ t-shirt prints, bakery packaging, Valentine’s Day decor, nursery art, social media graphics, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG creations!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Spread sweet retro charm, holiday magic, and playful warmth with Cutie Candy. This delightful font duo pairs a chunky, wavy bubble display font with a smooth, monoline script font, allowing you to mix and match for instant creative contrast. Packed with cheerful energy, heart-dotted accents, and soft rounded curves, it brings an irresistible, handcrafted personality to every design.</p>\n<p>Ideal for Christmas and holiday craft projects, cute sticker packs, kids’ t-shirt prints, bakery packaging, Valentine’s Day decor, nursery art, social media graphics, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG creations!</p>",
